cxr/models/visual.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted from the CheXagent project by Stanford AIMI:

    https://github.com/Stanford-AIMI/CheXagent
    standalone/chexagent_v3/models/modeling_visual.py

The file is a trimmed derivative containing only the `TransformCXR`
augmentation stack, the sinusoidal position-embedding helpers, and the
`CLIPModel` vision tower. Please consult the upstream repository for its
licensing terms before redistributing this file.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pretrained models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The pipeline downloads and uses the following pretrained weights at runtime.
They are not redistributed here and remain subject to their own licenses:

  DreamSim               https://github.com/ssundaram21/dreamsim
  Clinical Longformer    https://huggingface.co/yikuan8/Clinical-Longformer
  SigLIP                 https://huggingface.co/google/siglip-large-patch16-384

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
No imaging data is redistributed in this repository. CheXpert Plus,
MIMIC-CXR, and the Merlin Abdominal CT dataset are obtained from their
respective sources under their own data use agreements.
